holar.google.com/citations?hl%3Den%26user%3DNWdPabcAAAAJ%26view_op%3Dlist_works%26pagesize%3D100&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469594371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_9vred_O1Xioz8ewdwdV7\">great research on species distribution modeling</a> .Robert will give a talk about tools for spatial analysis in R.  Come with your spatial/geographic analysis questions!</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Note that this week&#39;s D-RUG will be in <b>2120J Wickson</b> - this is the room just to the right of our regular meeting space.  It will at the usual time: <b>1-3 PM</b>, with the usual snacks.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">See you there!</p><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Noam</p>\r\n</font></span></div></blockquote></div>"
